# Copyrighted emulator assets. These are consumed in place, never vendored:
#   PCem-ROMs-master/  third-party BIOS ROM images
#   PCem-ROMs-master.zip the archive they came from
#   Dos6.22.img        Microsoft MS-DOS 6.22 floppy image
# The 486 harness locates them by absolute path in tools/dos-toolchain.json
# (pcemRomset.path, dosImage.path) and pins both by SHA-256 there, so nothing
# needs them under version control.
PCem-ROMs-master/
PCem-ROMs-master.zip
Dos6.22.img

# Local emulator staging and run artifacts.
*.dmp
*.img
*.hdd
*.nvr
*.log

# Scratch scripts from the abandoned UI-automation layer. They live in the
# quake subproject and are deliberately not committed there; ignore the
# pattern here too so a stray copy at the wrapper root cannot land.
pcemctl.c
